# Push loop, pass 3: `agentdrop accept B41`, the acceptance loop.
# The project's checks (docs/checks) run first; a failure goes back to the worker, no judge.
# When they pass, a fresh headless judge reads the ticket, its spec, the diff since the claim
# and the check output, never the worker's report, and returns PASS, REJECT or BLOCKED.
# REJECT goes back to the worker; the ACCEPT_REJECTS-th REJECT and any BLOCKED go to the owner.
# Each step is recorded in docs/.runs/B41.json before it starts, so a crashed run resumes.

